# Known HIGH CVEs in github.com/docker/docker (Moby) Go SDK.
#
# These CVEs affect the Docker daemon/AuthZ plugin code paths. The upstream
# advisory lists Docker Engine/Moby 29.3.1 as the patched version, but the
# corresponding Go module tag (github.com/docker/docker@v29.3.1) has not yet
# been published to the Go module proxy. Ops Ronin is already pinned to the
# latest available module version (v28.5.2).
#
# Remove these entries once github.com/docker/docker@v29.3.1+incompatible
# (or newer) is available and go.mod has been updated.
